  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS WAF (Web Application Firewall) protects web applications from attack by allowing customers to block bad actors and provides filters against common web exploits like SQL injection.",
